    "id": "create-costing-for-persons",
    "title": "Create Costing for Persons in Oracle Cloud",
    "text": "# Create Costing for Persons in Oracle Cloud\nJob aid, last updated 8/4/26.\n\nPurpose: create costing for an employee's assignment in Oracle Cloud. Requires Oracle Cloud access with HCM permissions.\n\n## Step 1: Open Costing for Persons\nEither:\n1. From the Home page, search for the employee.\n2. Click the drop-down arrow next to the employee's name and select \"Costing for Persons\".\n\nOr:\n1. From the Oracle homepage, go to the \"Our Workforce\" tab.\n2. Select Costing for Persons from the \"Quick Actions\" menu.\n3. Search for the employee using the search bar or \"Advanced Search\".\n\n## Step 2: Select the assignment\n1. Under \"Costing for a Person Overview\", find the list of assignments.\n2. Click the specific assignment you need to add costing to.\n3. Click the \"Actions\" drop-down.\n4. Select \"Create\", then \"Create Costing\".\n\n## Step 3: Create the costing information\n1. Enter the effective date.\n2. Enter the Percentage (100% unless directed otherwise).\n3. Enter the correct Chart of Accounts (COA) string for the assignment.\n\n## Step 4: Submit\n1. Review the costing information for accuracy.\n2. Click Submit.\n\nNote: changes to costing are automatically approved by Oracle after submission."
